<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<project xmlns="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0"
         xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
         xsi:schemaLocation="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0 http://maven.apache.org/xsd/maven-4.0.0.xsd">
    <modelVersion>4.0.0</modelVersion>

    <parent>
        <groupId>com.telcobright</groupId>
        <artifactId>routesphere-seed-parent</artifactId>
        <version>1.0-SNAPSHOT</version>
    </parent>

    <artifactId>seed-callflow</artifactId>
    <name>seed-callflow</name>
    <description>The base call processing pipeline of a Telcobright switch, as a library (design: routesphere
        docs/architecture/call-flow-base.md, 2026-10-03). One base class, CallFlow: every application — an ad view, a voice
        call, an SMS — is a Call and runs the same multi-tenant flow: launch a pooled machine, preprocess, identify the
        partner, walk the tenant chain leaf to root (authorize, rate, reserve), route, signal, settle, publish one CDR
        record per tier to Kafka. An application overrides only its own steps. The machines come from a pool of a fixed
        size (statewalk 3.2.0). The Ad-typed classes of 2026-09-29 (AdCallPayload, ChainAdmission, LevelCdrWriter, …) are
        the earlier, ad-only shape: deprecated, removed when ad-sphere has moved onto CallFlow.</description>

    <properties>
        <statewalk.version>3.2.0</statewalk.version>
        <jackson.version>2.19.2</jackson.version>
        <kafka.version>3.7.1</kafka.version>
    </properties>

    <dependencies>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>com.telcobright</groupId>
            <artifactId>statewalk</artifactId>
            <version>${statewalk.version}</version>
        </dependency>
        <!-- the tenant tree, DynamicContext, Partner, LevelAdmission — the shape every switch shares -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>com.telcobright</groupId>
            <artifactId>rtc-domain</artifactId>
            <version>1.0-SNAPSHOT</version>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>com.fasterxml.jackson.core</groupId>
            <artifactId>jackson-databind</artifactId>
            <version>${jackson.version}</version>
        </dependency>
        <!-- the CDR road of every switch: one message per call on the tenant tree's cdr topic (KafkaCdrSink) -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.apache.kafka</groupId>
            <artifactId>kafka-clients</artifactId>
            <version>${kafka.version}</version>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.slf4j</groupId>
            <artifactId>slf4j-api</artifactId>
            <version>2.0.13</version>
        </dependency>

        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.junit.jupiter</groupId>
            <artifactId>junit-jupiter</artifactId>
            <version>5.10.2</version>
            <scope>test</scope>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.assertj</groupId>
            <artifactId>assertj-core</artifactId>
            <version>3.27.3</version>
            <scope>test</scope>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>com.h2database</groupId>
            <artifactId>h2</artifactId>
            <version>2.3.230</version>
            <scope>test</scope>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.slf4j</groupId>
            <artifactId>slf4j-simple</artifactId>
            <version>2.0.13</version>
            <scope>test</scope>
        </dependency>
    </dependencies>

    <build>
        <plugins>
            <plugin>
                <groupId>org.apache.maven.plugins</groupId>
                <artifactId>maven-surefire-plugin</artifactId>
                <version>3.2.5</version>
                <configuration>
                    <!-- *IT needs the local Kafka on 127.0.0.1:9092: it only runs with -Dseed.it=true -->
                    <includes>
                        <include>**/*Test.java</include>
                        <include>**/*IT.java</include>
                    </includes>
                </configuration>
            </plugin>
        </plugins>
    </build>

    <repositories>
        <repository>
            <id>github-telcobright-statewalk</id>
            <url>https://maven.pkg.github.com/pialmmh/statewalk</url>
            <releases><enabled>true</enabled></releases>
            <snapshots><enabled>false</enabled></snapshots>
        </repository>
    </repositories>
</project>
